ימי קדם ); וָדֹר דֹּר שְׁנוֺת Deut 32:7 (song; || עולם ימות ); וָדֹר בְּדֹר Psa 90:1 (compare 90:2 ); דּוֺרוָֿדוֺר מוֺסְדֵי Isa 58:12 (|| עולם חרבות ); וָדוֺר דּוֺר שֹׁמֲמוֺת 61:4 (|| id. ) b. usually of duration to come , future age(s) , דֹּר לְדֹר Exod 3:15 (E; || לעולם ) compare Prov 27:24 Kt (Qr וָדוֺר לְדוֺר ; || id. ); דֹּר מִדֹּר Exod 17:16 (E), = לָדוֺר מִדּוֺר Isa 34:10 ; וָדֹר לְדֹר Psa 10:6 ; 33:11 (|| לעולם ) 49:12 ; 79:13 ; 85:6 ; 102:13 ; 119:90 ; 135:13 ; 146:10 ; Joel 4:20 (all || id. ); 89:2 (|| עולם ) 89:5 (|| עדעֿולם ) 106:31 (|| id. ) Isa 34:17 (|| id. ); Psa 77:9 (|| לנצח ); וָדֹר עַדדֹּֿר 100:5 (|| לעולם ) Isa 13:20 (|| לנצח ) Jer 50:39 (|| id. ); וָדֹר בְּכָלדֹּֿר Jeremiah 45:18 (|| ועד לעולם ) compare Est 9:28 ; וָדֹר דֹר כְּמוֺ שְׁנוֺתָיו Psa 61:7 compare וָדוֺר דּוֺר שְׁנֵי Joel 2:2 (|| העולם ); as modifying phrase וָדוֺר דּוֺר מְשׂוֺשׂ Isa 60:15 (|| עולם נאון ); further דּוֺרִים דּוֺר Psa 72:5 ; דּוֺרִים לְדוֺר יְשׁוּעָתִי Isa 51:8 (|| לעולם ). c. apparently including both past and future שְׁנוֺתֶיךָ דּוֺרִים בְּדוֺר Psa 102:25 ; וָדֹר דּוֺר בְּכָל 145:13 ; וָדוֺר לְדוֺר Lam 5:19 . 2 of men living at a particular time (period, age), generation , as transitory בָּא וְדוֺר הֹלֵךְ דּוֺר Eccl 1:4 : specifically a. in the present , and (or) the past Gen 7:1 (J) Exod 1:6 (P) Num 32:13 (JE) Deut 1:35 ; 2:14 ; Judg 2:10 (twice in verse); Isa 53:8 (compare Che critical note) Jer 2:31 ; also Psa 95:10 ; Job 8:8 ; Isa 41:4 . b. Judg 3:2 (present & future); compare plural דֹּרֹתָיו Gen 6:9 (i.e. his own Generation and those immediately contiguous, before and after). c. especially of a future Generation Gen 15:16 (JE), with numeral, compare Deut 23:3 ; 23:4 ; 23:9 ; also 29:21 ; Psa 48:14 ; 71:18 ; 78:4 ; 78:6 ; 102:19 ; 109:13 ; Joel 1:3 compare Psa 22:31 ; Psalm 22:32 (Che critical note ); of a succession of Generations מַעֲשֶׂיךָ יְשַׂבַּח לְדוֺר דּוֺר 145:4 ; וָדוֺר בְּכָלדּֿוֺר Est 9:28 ; usually plural עוֺלָם לְדֹרֹת Gen 9:12 (P); with number דּוֺר לְאֶלֶף Psa 105:8 (|| עולם ) = 1Chr 16:15 (|| לעולם ); Deut 7:9 ; see further, of posterity, דֹּרוֺת אַרְבָּעָה Job 42:16 ; usually plural with suffix Gen 17:7 , 9 , 12 ; Exod 12:14 , 17 , 42 ; 16:32-33 , 27:21 ; 29:42 ; 30:8 , 10 , 21 , 31 ; 31:13 , 16 ; 40:15 ; Lev 3:17 ; 6:11 ; 7:36 ; 10:9 (all P); 17:7 ; 21:17 ; 22:3 ; 23:14 , 21 , 31 , 41 , 43 ; 24:3 ; 25:30 (all H); Num 9:10 ; 10:8 ; 15:14-15 , 21 , 23 , 38 ; 18:23 ; 35:29 ; Josh 22:27-28 , (all P). 3 generation characterized by quality or condition , class of men: עִקֵּשׁ דּוֺר crooked Generation Deut 32:5 (song) compare 32:20 ; Psa 78:8 (twice in verse); Jer 7:29 ; of different classes of wicked, Prov 30:11-12 , 13 , 14 compare Psa 12:8 ; of the righteous, as a class 14:5 ; 24:6 ; 73:15 ( דּוֺר בָּנֶיךָ ) 112:2 (compare 22:31 ᵑ0 , but &lt; Che joins לדור to Psalm 22:32 compare above below 2c ); so also אֲבוֺתָיו דּוֺר i.e. the dead 49:20 (so most; yet see below below 4 ). 4 dwelling-place, habitation Isa 38:12 compare דּוּר verb, so Saad Ki Ges De Che RVm (Ew life || חַיַּי ); so also Psa 49:20 De Witt, compare Che OP 479 . דָּר noun [masculine] generation (Biblical Hebrew דּוֺר ); — absolute in phrase וְדָו עִםדָּֿר Daniel 3:33; Dan 4:31 (is) with Generation and Generation , i.e. endures Generation after Generation.","rootNote":"or (shortened) דֹּר ; from 1752 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 15","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 15","Deut 1 35","Deut 2 14","Deut 7 9","Deut 23 3","Deut 23 4","Deut 23 9","Deut 29 21"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":168,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"דּֽוֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 1 35","book":"Deut","chapter":1,"verse":35,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/דּ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 2 14","book":"Deut","chapter":2,"vers